+    let-binding whose bound expression uses a promised variable is deferred
+    ([bs_ctx.deferred_lets]) until that variable is bound, the other ones are
+    emitted in order, followed by the deferred let-bindings which they make
+    ready. Delaying pure let-bindings preserves the semantics. A promised
